{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》主要演員包括：楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤、鄺潔楹等。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;昨晚（10日）一集焦點絕對是林夏薇，飾演雲生身邊大紅人的她，每個造型均極之亮麗，為凸顯天</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.413367+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:20:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:37.169305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:37.169305+00:00","content_hash":"dcc38c703cc83e338c2a2da1e8ce5e48b3ea07ee288f94ef84c41a527918452c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}